      "type": "text",
      "mode": "markdown",
      "content": "## LLM Usage\nAggregate LLM consumption and accounting from ATI's authoritative usage ledger.\n\n- This dashboard reports aggregate LLM consumption/accounting.\n- **Agents & LLM** remains the execution/latency/failure dashboard.\n- Missing usage means **unavailable/unknown**, not zero.\n- Monetary values are **known cost** computed from versioned pricing, not a provider invoice.\n- Prompts, outputs, and hidden chain-of-thought are never shown.\n",
      "title": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5
      },
      "title": "LLM calls",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "ati-prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "ati-prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum(ati_llm_calls_total)",
          "instant": false,
          "format": 0,
          "hideEmpty": false,
          "legendFormat": "calls",
          "limit": 0,
          "logQuery": "",
          "queryType": "",
          "queryshowhelp": false,
          "useLastPointInGraph": false
        }
      ]
    },
